": "05 - Signal in Transit.png", "id": "1679165517189131", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604289492_1679165520522464_1776060159597882716_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BjvmzEcuqWIQ7kNvwEyJAWK&_nc_oc=AdpBJx-He_9AzThaB82KeDReYiPKlrO0cVs8FvUen_YlMWAly9ypBVYq08RiR83NUYI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSAJFi-XgxUIONCylo73NB-YhlKqVwaUP6qwe1vnCSFJg&oe=6B0DB5FB"}, {"file_name": "01 - Inside Relay 07.png", "id": "1109779785002333", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673573223_1109779788335666_4994145840308165961_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rnEhyDXzquYQ7kNvwGA36bK&_nc_oc=AdqaSvw9aRAmJavc02g47jFfKCoPNyfrbzE2PmD4so7PZlk4CnwmzrPkV0k93PwcM3I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSwhYncpgqBX6czReSwUGS-zcaGDG5XTzkVe1ea3Ltqsw&oe=6B0DBE62"}, {"file_name": "03 - Tune the Phase.png", "id": "1428571219361576", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/613086565_1428571222694909_280296246554693634_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Yz3eFLKSBkAQ7kNvwGEdzeT&_nc_oc=Ado3mIRHFsfg23kKedJWmX6toYceBRm6F_v2YwD4wolcefjGGNpHkMbISZWSJJ1aszc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS-ptbudeRCDQsw6IpUvKSMvUF9QFydoBvno5ZH7HZuDg&oe=6B0DA1E6"}, {"file_name": "04 - Purge the Line.png", "id": "1145662767918644", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604293968_1145662771251977_2889111749548878348_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-qPqLxZHRNwQ7kNvwGIfUe0&_nc_oc=AdqQ0iXmcCmZ4jvgkkxcpJXj7LdEKiGlahviGeXNanN-4tLN6cIaDZFsT4SOcbxK0nE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQS4mIEJVqYvTojaxM4V7jgc1ZJzfN-XQFarT54XCKdF-g&oe=6B0DA93C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "1502922778417494", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673645340_1502922781750827_2827188571473636067_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DMyou8y6QWcQ7kNvwG48mGr&_nc_oc=AdplRGlOdozgrertKKMUoydx14ANrAZGkDEk1WAOPkxDkzz9H0EzbtPKPy9f3M6Z9Os&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTF0j2Oy7ySZp9of_nMvRwVM_okyDcnJL1HcaYPWQx_jQ&oe=6B0DC00A"}, "display_name": "Trench Signal VR", "keywords": ["puzzle", "underwater", "dispatch", "submarine", "sea"], "long_description": "A landslide cuts three deep-sea stations off from the surface. You're on duty at Relay 07, and the rescue crews need you to get their messages through.\n\nTake the next signal cartridge, seat it in the cradle, and scan it for its destination and phase. Turn the dials to match, purge the line when pressure builds, then transmit. Watch the receiver light up beyond the viewport as your signal reaches it. Later shifts bring heavier traffic and cartridges that need to be routed twice.\n\n- Campaign. Restore the network across 12 shifts. Replay completed contracts to improve your medals and scores.\n- Endless. Each successful dispatch buys you more time. Keep up as traffic and pressure build, and try to beat your personal best.\n- Guided practice. Learn the console with spoken cues and on-screen prompts. Switch off the campaign timer in Settings to play the story at your own pace.\n\nOperate the station with touch controllers, seated or standing.", "short_description": "Three undersea stations have gone silent.\n\nFrom the console at Relay 07, grab and scan signal cartridges, tune the dials, and send rescue traffic through before time runs out.\n\nPlay 12 campaign shifts, train in guided practice, or chase a personal best in Endless. Prefer to take your time? Switch off the campaign timer."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://faizanbashirarain.github.io/caffeinestudios/trench-signal-privacy-policy.html", "developer